# chatapi_app

FastAPI chat application with OpenAI and Gemini providers. Each conversation uses one
provider, preserves provider-specific context, and stores saved history locally as JSON.

## Project structure

```text
chatbot_app_v2/
├─ .env
├─ .gitignore
├─ README.md
├─ app.py
├─ main.py
├─ requirements.txt
├─ src/                         # canonical production package
│  ├─ __init__.py
│  ├─ api/
│  │  ├─ __init__.py
