│  └─ utils/
│     ├─ __init__.py
│     ├─ conversation_store.py    # JSON persistence helper for saved conversations
│     └─ input_sanitizer.py       # normalization + prompt-injection and profanity validation
├─ data/                         # runtime-generated app data (ignored in Git)
